					"usage_notes": "Pincer (16): thrust 6d cutting (KYOS: 8d cutting), Reach C-1. The glabrezu can either nip and let go or hold on and grapple the victim in addition to injuring him. Either is an attack that takes full hit location penalties – not halved for grappling. Treat this attack as a bite for these purposes (see Teeth on page 115 of GURPS Martial Arts for details). The pincers give +2 with tasks that require a firm grip (including climbing)."
